{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1822", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1822/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1822/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1822/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1822", "id": 1286517480, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5MrrLo", "number": 1822, "title": "libmavsdk.so.1: cannot open shared object file for armv7", "user": {"login": "Katawann", "id": 23118386, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTE4Mzg2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23118386?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann", "html_url": "https://github.com/Katawann", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2022-06-27T22:36:06Z", "updated_at": "2022-06-30T15:06:18Z", "closed_at": "2022-06-28T13:29:54Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I need to build locally .deb package for armv7 as the v1.4.3 does not include some fix\r\n\r\nWhen I build my code in a docker using the online debian package from release v1.3.1 everything works fine. But  when I generate locally the deb package of v1.3.1 or v1.4.3 if fails with error:\r\n```\r\nerror while loading shared libraries: libmavsdk.so.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat need to be changed in my commands to make it works as if I was downloading the deb package ?\r\n```\r\n./dockcross-linux-armv7-custom /bin/bash -c \"cmake $superbuild $cmake_prefix_path -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=build/linux-armv7/install -DBUILD_MAVSDK_SERVER=OFF -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -DWERROR=OFF -DMAVLINK_HEADERS=mavlink-headers/include -Bbuild/linux-armv7 -H.\"\r\n./dockcross-linux-armv7-custom cmake --build build/linux-armv7 -j8 --target install\r\n./dockcross-linux-armv7-custom tools/create_packages.sh ./build/linux-armv7/install . armv7 libmavsdk-dev\r\n```\r\n\r\nThank you for your help !\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "Katawann", "id": 23118386, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTE4Mzg2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23118386?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann", "html_url": "https://github.com/Katawann", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Katawann/events{/privacy}"